{"2598580": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Seekers of the Ancient", "steam_appid": 2598580, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6d80e3ac8b843e2c6d4acd4c004e28ca.webp?t=1783367867\" width=780 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an open world full of ancient secrets, powerful artifacts, and untold legends. Become a Seeker: roam the land, fight deadly creatures, help the people you meet and forge your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/7bda82e3f21d3d8e1ed50fe8b0d05714.avif?t=1783367867\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras_big/7bda82e3f21d3d8e1ed50fe8b0d05714.webp?t=1783367867 width=1560 height=72 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6f86174a7fb9258c4af35ce658d8e68e.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a world where each region has its own history. Wander through the lands to uncover local secrets, hidden tales, and small details as you progress your character through various quests and activities. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/023c8c074fceef0fc3eb3c7610a54659.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/023c8c074fceef0fc3eb3c7610a54659.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/023c8c074fceef0fc3eb3c7610a54659.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/5cf5d15f816d203b68613364e8c0b318.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a combat system inspired by the timeless formulas of classic fantasy RPGs. The system relies on character power, game knowledge, and tactical skill. Face a wide variety of enemies, from simple creatures to powerful bosses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/ee3537ad4fa8ca0e436db18b83287185.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/ee3537ad4fa8ca0e436db18b83287185.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/ee3537ad4fa8ca0e436db18b83287185.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/a2cf5f1d7b21917e46395f4da59fb8ec.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Search for elite equipment. Defeat creatures with varied loot tables and find equipment with random stat rolls to gradually optimize your character’s build.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/cac16ec341bd11b719b9238c629b18ad.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/cac16ec341bd11b719b9238c629b18ad.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/cac16ec341bd11b719b9238c629b18ad.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/fe5ae270ea725c524069a5f9c668bfc8.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover crafting stations tucked away in the world. Some offer unique recipes that can’t be found anywhere else, allowing you to forge specialized items for your journey. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/72322f37d4d814606a78150e47638cba.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=776 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/72322f37d4d814606a78150e47638cba.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/72322f37d4d814606a78150e47638cba.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/159e67faef06fd33def46ec41d980b5f.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shape your character's growth with an extensive talent system. Choose from a wide variety of abilities to define your role and refine your combat style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/be57906a6aba91ea8441f0c9a974a150.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/be57906a6aba91ea8441f0c9a974a150.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/be57906a6aba91ea8441f0c9a974a150.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/fdaed1e15dec44a6a74bcd078e1229fc.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy the housing system to create a cozy base. Build your house from the ground up and welcome friends to explore your creation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/d73ef358f180640ba8651c36df1e9439.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/d73ef358f180640ba8651c36df1e9439.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/d73ef358f180640ba8651c36df1e9439.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/b053327b650a52032b3eda63af92ca43.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looking for a challenge? Enable PvP outside of safe zones to test your build against other players and engage with rivals in the wilds. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/51f6bec38a13fdb885d12075c04b2973.poster.avif?t=1783367867\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/51f6bec38a13fdb885d12075c04b2973.webm?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/51f6bec38a13fdb885d12075c04b2973.mp4?t=1783367867\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/f8f651b73f29b4e8357efc75acfb8d62.avif?t=1783367867\" width=390 height=100 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2598580/extras/6d80e3ac8b843e2c6d4acd4c004e28ca.webp?t=1783367867\" width=780 height=43 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an open world full of ancient secrets, powerful artifacts, and untold legends. Become a Seeker: roam the land, fight deadly creatures, help the people you meet and forge your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.c